# FABLE-GROKBOT-MATRIX-20260924-143 cell: an existing non-callable Structure binding x a Structure reference.  A
# non-callable binding is an explicit reference, `@: Model b` -- a `Model: b` value is callable, `b: a` its call
# (OPUS-CALLABLE-STRUCT-BINDING-20260929-16) -- and its rebinding `b: a` runs the admission first (implements(a, Model,
# Model), the interim structural admission) and binds a Model: a's 5 read through b.  Entry 7.  (Was
# unit_matrix_noncall_struct_rebind_refused: the typed-typed rebinding was fail-closed.)
Model:
    size_t: value 1U
end: Model

fn: probe () int
    a: merge Model
    @: Model b
    size_t: v 0U
    int: out 0
    a\value: 5U
    b: a
    v: b\value
    if: v = 5U
        out: 7
    return: out
end: probe

sendMessage: exit(exit_code: probe(); stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
